WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.067
Video fifteen. The main reports of your books,
and what each one shows.

00:00:05.367 --> 00:00:11.116
D opens Display More Reports. T is the Trial
Balance: the closing balance of each group.

00:00:11.815 --> 00:00:18.097
The debit total and the credit total are the
same: ₹13,70,370.

00:00:18.127 --> 00:00:22.079
Alt+F5 shows the details: each ledger under
its group.

00:00:22.109 --> 00:00:27.594
F2 changes the period. Type the dates: here, 1
April to 31 May.

00:00:31.596 --> 00:00:35.745
Esc twice, and P opens the Profit and Loss
account of the year.

00:00:36.446 --> 00:00:41.796
Sales and the closing stock give a gross
profit of ₹65,833.

00:00:41.446 --> 00:00:46.995
The indirect expenses are ₹69,500, so the year
has a net loss.

00:00:47.025 --> 00:00:51.376
Alt+F5 shows each ledger: rent, salary and
electricity.

00:00:51.856 --> 00:00:55.342
The gross profit is smaller than the indirect
expenses.

00:00:55.272 --> 00:00:59.889
The difference is the net loss: ₹3,667.

00:01:00.088 --> 00:01:05.573
Salary is the largest expense: ₹40,000 of
₹69,500.

00:01:05.873 --> 00:01:10.891
Esc, and B opens the Balance Sheet: what the
business owns, and what it owes.

00:01:11.008 --> 00:01:17.891
Both sides total ₹11,66,370. The loss of the
year shows on the assets side.

00:01:18.508 --> 00:01:23.459
Alt+F5 shows the parts: the bank, the cash,
the stock and the debtors.

00:01:24.539 --> 00:01:27.957
Esc, and R opens Ratio Analysis.

00:01:28.657 --> 00:01:36.474
The current ratio is 27 to 1. The gross profit is 32%
of sales, and the net profit is (-)1.8%.

00:01:38.707 --> 00:01:46.325
Esc, and O opens the Dashboard: sales, purchases, cash
and bank, receivables, and ratios, in tiles.

00:01:46.355 --> 00:01:49.639
Each tile shows the numbers of the year at one
look.

00:01:50.805 --> 00:01:54.089
Next: the Stock Summary and the outstandings.

